# face-voice-core
FACE Voice is a voice-first AI system for real-time performance feedback, presence amplification, and autonomous creator training. It powers the AI Performance Mirror, Unseen Audience, and Vibe-Curation Engine that helps DJs, artists, and speakers reach elite performance without platforms or middlemen.

